{
  "title": "What thor-demo adds to an aidemo workflow",
  "targetLengthSeconds": 58,
  "captions": {
    "style": "none",
    "track": true
  },
  "hold": {
    "mode": "freeze"
  },
  "attention": {
    "color": "#8cc8ff",
    "cursorClear": true
  },
  "cursor": {
    "hidden": true
  },
  "hide": ["nav"],
  "voice": {
    "pronounce": {
      "aidemo": "A.I. demo",
      "aidemo’s": "A.I. demo’s",
      "mlx-audio": "M.L.X. audio",
      "OpenAI": "Open A.I.",
      "thor-demo": "thor demo",
      "revoice": "reevoice",
      "provenance": "prahvenance"
    }
  },
  "output": {
    "chapters": true
  },
  "scenes": [
    {
      "id": "open",
      "title": "What thor-demo adds",
      "narration": "aidemo {{@aidemo}}renders narrated demos. {{@adds}}thor-demo adds three things: {{@config}}a configuration per repository, {{@archive}}an archive of every take, {{@voice}}and narration in your own voice.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "op": "goto",
          "url": "http://127.0.0.1:8787/adds/01-open.html"
        },
        {
          "op": "waitFor",
          "target": {
            "selector": "#core"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "spotlight",
          "target": {
            "selector": "#core"
          },
          "holdMs": 1650,
          "anchor": "aidemo"
        },
        {
          "op": "click",
          "target": {
            "selector": "#ring-label"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "spotlight",
          "target": {
            "selector": "#ring"
          },
          "holdMs": 2000,
          "anchor": "adds"
        },
        {
          "op": "highlight",
          "target": {
            "selector": "#tile-config"
          },
          "holdMs": 2200,
          "anchor": "config"
        },
        {
          "op": "pause",
          "ms": 800
        },
        {
          "op": "highlight",
          "target": {
            "selector": "#tile-archive"
          },
          "holdMs": 1800,
          "anchor": "archive"
        },
        {
          "op": "pause",
          "ms": 650
        },
        {
          "op": "highlight",
          "target": {
            "selector": "#tile-voice"
          },
          "holdMs": 2450,
          "anchor": "voice"
        },
        {
          "op": "pause",
          "ms": 800
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "config",
      "title": "Per-repository configuration",
      "narration": "aidemo’s CLI {{@shell}}and its MCP server {{@agent}}read different environments, {{@key}}so an inherited OpenAI key can send captions off this machine. {{@with}}thor-demo gives both the environment in {{@file}}the repository’s thor-demo.yaml, {{@strip}}and drops that key unless the file allows it.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "op": "goto",
          "url": "http://127.0.0.1:8787/adds/02-config.html"
        },
        {
          "op": "waitFor",
          "target": {
            "selector": "#config-without"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "highlight",
          "target": {
            "selector": "#shell"
          },
          "holdMs": 1300,
          "anchor": "shell"
        },
        {
          "op": "highlight",
          "target": {
            "selector": "#mcp"
          },
          "holdMs": 2000,
          "anchor": "agent"
        },
        {
          "op": "click",
          "target": {
            "selector": "#leak"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "highlight",
          "target": {
            "selector": "#leak"
          },
          "holdMs": 3000,
          "anchor": "key"
        },
        {
          "op": "pause",
          "ms": 1000
        },
        {
          "op": "click",
          "target": {
            "selector": "#config-with .panel-label"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "spotlight",
          "target": {
            "selector": "#config-with"
          },
          "holdMs": 2800,
          "anchor": "with"
        },
        {
          "op": "pause",
          "ms": 1250
        },
        {
          "op": "highlight",
          "target": {
            "selector": "#config-file"
          },
          "holdMs": 2300,
          "anchor": "file"
        },
        {
          "op": "click",
          "target": {
            "selector": "#strip"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "highlight",
          "target": {
            "selector": "#strip"
          },
          "holdMs": 3000,
          "anchor": "strip"
        },
        {
          "op": "pause",
          "ms": 1000
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "archive",
      "title": "Archived takes",
      "narration": "aidemo keeps {{@latest}}only the latest render, {{@discard}}discarding earlier takes. thor-demo {{@files}}keeps every take in a customizable location, {{@provenance}}with a provenance record: {{@engine}}engine, {{@voice}}voice, {{@options}}options, {{@hashes}}and a hash of every file.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "op": "goto",
          "url": "http://127.0.0.1:8787/adds/03-archive.html"
        },
        {
          "op": "waitFor",
          "target": {
            "selector": "#folder"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "highlight",
          "target": {
            "selector": "#out-new"
          },
          "holdMs": 1600,
          "anchor": "latest"
        },
        {
          "op": "click",
          "target": {
            "selector": "#out-old"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "highlight",
          "target": {
            "selector": "#out-old"
          },
          "holdMs": 2500,
          "anchor": "discard"
        },
        {
          "op": "click",
          "target": {
            "selector": "#archive-with .panel-label"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "spotlight",
          "target": {
            "selector": "#shelf"
          },
          "holdMs": 3000,
          "anchor": "files"
        },
        {
          "op": "click",
          "target": {
            "selector": "#prov"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "spotlight",
          "target": {
            "selector": "#prov"
          },
          "holdMs": 1750,
          "anchor": "provenance"
        },
        {
          "op": "highlight",
          "target": {
            "selector": "#prov-engine"
          },
          "holdMs": 450,
          "anchor": "engine"
        },
        {
          "op": "highlight",
          "target": {
            "selector": "#prov-voice"
          },
          "holdMs": 400,
          "anchor": "voice"
        },
        {
          "op": "highlight",
          "target": {
            "selector": "#prov-options"
          },
          "holdMs": 550,
          "anchor": "options"
        },
        {
          "op": "highlight",
          "target": {
            "selector": "#prov-files"
          },
          "holdMs": 1900,
          "anchor": "hashes"
        },
        {
          "op": "pause",
          "ms": 1000
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "voice",
      "title": "Voice clone",
      "narration": "aidemo’s local {{@stock}}voice is a stock voice. {{@clone}}thor-demo clones yours from a short recording, {{@proxy}}and revoice narrates with it {{@local}}on this machine.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "op": "goto",
          "url": "http://127.0.0.1:8787/adds/04-voice.html"
        },
        {
          "op": "waitFor",
          "target": {
            "selector": "#voice-stock"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "highlight",
          "target": {
            "selector": "#voice-stock"
          },
          "holdMs": 1550,
          "anchor": "stock"
        },
        {
          "op": "click",
          "target": {
            "selector": "#voice-with .panel-label"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "spotlight",
          "target": {
            "selector": "#profile"
          },
          "holdMs": 3000,
          "anchor": "clone"
        },
        {
          "op": "pause",
          "ms": 550
        },
        {
          "op": "click",
          "target": {
            "selector": "#proxy"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "highlight",
          "target": {
            "selector": "#boundary .chain"
          },
          "holdMs": 1850,
          "anchor": "proxy"
        },
        {
          "op": "click",
          "target": {
            "selector": "#mlx"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "highlight",
          "target": {
            "selector": "#boundary"
          },
          "holdMs": 1200,
          "anchor": "local"
        },
        {
          "op": "pause",
          "ms": 1000
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "close",
      "title": "Install",
      "narration": "To use demo-tools, {{@install}}install it alongside aidemo; {{@render}}then render, {{@revoice}}and revoice.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "op": "goto",
          "url": "http://127.0.0.1:8787/adds/05-close.html"
        },
        {
          "op": "waitFor",
          "target": {
            "selector": "#close-install"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "pause",
          "ms": 200
        },
        {
          "op": "highlight",
          "target": {
            "selector": "#close-install"
          },
          "holdMs": 2200,
          "anchor": "install"
        },
        {
          "op": "pause",
          "ms": 600
        },
        {
          "op": "highlight",
          "target": {
            "selector": "#close-render"
          },
          "holdMs": 900,
          "anchor": "render"
        },
        {
          "op": "highlight",
          "target": {
            "selector": "#close-revoice"
          },
          "holdMs": 1050,
          "anchor": "revoice"
        },
        {
          "op": "pause",
          "ms": 600
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
